{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06318","headline":"泗上冯使君南楼作 · 祖咏","name":"泗上冯使君南楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"井邑连淮泗，南楼向晚过。\n望滩沙鹭起，寻岸浴童歌。\n近海云偏出，兼秋雨更多。\n明晨拟回棹，乡思恨风波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}